              "text": "Cn Compare Gk: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "the wood and the highest bough",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " which they deserted because of the children of Israel, and there will be desolation.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.9",
